stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open: POST /patients/me/tickets (Ticket Created by Agent / Patient)
    
    Open --> InProgress: Staff Begins Review & Investigation
    Open --> Resolved: Direct Quick Resolution
    
    InProgress --> Resolved: Solution / Information Provided to Patient
    
    Resolved --> Closed: Staff Confirms Resolution - deferred auth contract (Archive)
    Resolved --> InProgress: Staff Reopens - deferred auth contract

    Closed --> [*]: Archived Ticket
